# Lab 10: alamat RabbitMQ untuk order-service dan notification-service.
# Default (jika tidak diisi): amqp://localhost  (RabbitMQ di Docker lokal)
# Jika memakai RabbitMQ cloud, isi lewat environment variable AMQP_URL (JANGAN tulis kredensial asli di file yang di-commit):
#   Linux/macOS : AMQP_URL="amqps://user:password@host/vhost" node order-service/order-service.js
#   PowerShell  : $env:AMQP_URL="amqps://user:password@host/vhost"; node order-service/order-service.js
AMQP_URL=amqp://localhost
